<title>RUSSIA: Rouble fixed at 3,320 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble fixed at 3,320 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble was set at 3,320 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange on Friday.</p>
<p>				    Mar 7		   Mar 6</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,320		   3,325</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
